jumpscreen-newgame-args.patch -- diagnostic jumpscreen arguments for the New Game screens (cleanroom oracle only).
Adds -jumpscreen newgame_race:selected=N / newgame_banner:selected=N (highlights row N, e.g. the Random
row) used by tools/fixtures/new_game_choose_race_random and new_game_choose_banner_random.
Independent of human-gate.patch: applies to pristine 1oom HEAD alone and together (git apply --check).
Split out of human-gate.patch 2026-10-15; touches src/game/game.c, src/ui/classic/uijumpscreen.c,
src/ui/classic/uinewgame.c and uinewgame.h.

